  "intro": [
    "Every CloudWatch Metrics operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane",
    "does with it. The service is signed with the `monitoring` credential scope and",
    "answers the JSON, CBOR and Query protocols; there is no console action. Metrics,",
    "alarms, composite alarms and dashboards are records held in memory, and an alarm",
    "is evaluated against the data points already published to its metric. Tags apply",
    "to an alarm's ARN, so an alarm has to exist before it can be tagged."
  ],
